/3771510/1d3412fee16dbfda7627a295f1a5bbf1d1ed56a9/ss_1d3412fee16dbfda7627a295f1a5bbf1d1ed56a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751453397","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/1d3412fee16dbfda7627a295f1a5bbf1d1ed56a9/ss_1d3412fee16dbfda7627a295f1a5bbf1d1ed56a9.600x338.jpg?t=1751453397"}],"short_description":"Here's a challenge for you: In this simple, 2D isometric combat game where the focus lies in the boss fights, everyone expects you to show the Naga Cult why the Pilgrims named you their champion!","steam_appid":3771510,"support_info":{"email":"eurgava@gmail.com","url":"https://gamejolt.com/games/eurgavapathforgers/475983"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://gamejolt.com/games/eurgavapathforgers/475983"}